  "body": "I have run into a problem that If a navigable is destroyed while a session history entry is being populated, all subsequent steps will fail because active window and active document will no longer exist for this navigable.\r\n\r\nSpecifically I had to add early returns if navigable is destroyed in following places:\r\n- Step 20 that runs subsequent steps in parallel in [navigate](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#attempt-to-populate-the-history-entry's-document). Navigable could be destroyed between step 20 and the rest of steps that are supposed to run in parallel. \r\n- Before step 6 in [attempt to populate the history entry's document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#attempt-to-populate-the-history-entry's-document). Navigable could be destroyed while waiting for fetch response.\r\n\r\n",
